{"format_version": 2, "segments": [{"kind": "text", "text": "ἄνευθε, before a vowel ἄνευ-θεν· (ἄνευ):—Ep. and Lyr. word: Prep. c. gen., like ἄνευ , without,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οἶος ἄνευθ' ἄλλων Il. 22.39", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μούνω ἄνευθ' ἄλλων Od. 16.239", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄ. πόνου 7.192", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἄ. θεοῦ, = ἄνευ θεοῦ ,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "11.5.185", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pi. O. 9.103", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(v.l.). away from,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄνευθεν ἄγων πατρός τε φίλων τε 11.21.78", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ".—Hom.always puts it before its case, though sts. parted from it, as ἄ. δέ σε μέγα νῶϊν ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "22.88", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; later it freq. follows, as"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "πατρὸς ἄνευθεν A.R. 4.746", "author_abbreviation": "A.R.", "tlg_author": "0001", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". Adv. far away, distant, αἱ δέ τ' ἄνευθε [νῆσοι]"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 9.26", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τοὶ δ' ἄλλοι ἄνευθεν καίοντ' 11.23.241", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐγγύθι μοι θάνατος κακὸς οὐδ' ἔτ' ἄνευθεν 22.300", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὐδέ . . ἄνευθ' ἔσαν ἀλλὰ μάλ' ἐγγύς 23.378", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἄ. λείπειν leave far away,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pi. P. 1.10", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ":—often with part.,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄ. ἐών 11.2.27", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "4.277", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "."}]}